  "body": "Step 2 in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#the-location-interface performs:\r\n> 2. Perform ! location.[[DefineOwnProperty]](\"toString\", { [[Value]]: %ObjProto_toString%, [[Writable]]: false, [[Enumerable]]: false, [[Configurable]]: false }).\r\n\r\n@annevk told me that this contradicts the [Unforgeable] stringifier which is defined later.\r\n\r\nOriginally filed at https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1333045.",
